D.106.0100. - The system shall allow Data Resolution Workflow privileges to be (No Access, View only, Open queries only, Respond only to opened queries, Open and respond to queries; Open, close, and respond to queries).
D.106.0200. - The system shall support the ability to open, close, reopen and respond to queries.
D.106.0300. - The system shall support the ability to filter issues based on records, fields, events and users.
D.106.0400. - The system shall support the ability to upload files to queries. 
D.106.0500. - The system shall support the ability to email and send messages via REDCap messenger with a link to issues.
D.106.0600. - The system shall have the ability to verify and de-verify data value based on user rights.
D.106.0700. - The system shall have the ability to automatically de-verify data that has been verified and subsequently changed.
D.106.0800. - The system shall have the ability to add comments to fields.
D.106.0900. - The system shall have the ability to filter comments based on records, events, fields, users and keywords.
D.106.1000. - The system shall support the ability to prevent calc/CALCTEXT fields with closed/verified data queries from being fixed by Data Quality rule H when using the Data Resolution Workflow.
